        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 54011PT, Entry Petal Key in Knob with Arched #11 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cast Bronze Petal Knob with Arched Rose is available in a flack black or medium bronze finish. Each of the finishes grant a rustic look that make it a great choice for historic homes. The petal knob has a Tuscan style that suits traditional homes wonderfully. The Petal Key in Knob with Arched #11 Rosette is available in a keyed entry function and also a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. It will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/petal-knob-with-arched-rose-emtek-70511pt\"><b>Petal Knob with Arched Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Keyed Lost Wax Cast Bronze Petal Knob with #11 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cast-bronze-finish.jpg?v=1704354518\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
